le_name": "BlindSimulator_Bus.png", "id": "1003437577895913", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391969_1003437581229246_653195394531631588_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rESGCFPIWPQQ7kNvwG1W-l1&_nc_oc=Ado6aP7Qhg1yYlW9AghQTjowgtNmzOsl_5GNcQkwqvkv7VSOYRPGM_BqQJAhcDBEbQY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-ecEeifvusx32f8sHl3NYoriuzhySB2YpkOqQT_yhypw&oe=6A301F3E"}, {"file_name": "BlindSimulator_Stair.png", "id": "4044188659173246", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391885_4044188662506579_7546195151401081343_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-YICfY0PSsYQ7kNvwHhjxdl&_nc_oc=AdpS7K28WephWYaLBMX_geXX16luyYsZFIKHO6QSf3NYKBlnwvvAStvRsvLwnufKvTM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9M3_E7LAVvI_C3y7Onmrhh2f3WLc8LpVJxBBPWwJbEZQ&oe=6A30179A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Cover_Image.png", "id": "1367209481281777", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473396584_1367209484615110_5666152302652103209_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E210zjDZrTcQ7kNvwFW85VH&_nc_oc=Adp_KyWd2lLSiZ-ky-Ld2TBfsP1GtVF66uD3rTT7-2MgL08ZHBuLkzI4yi7J578x36I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_HxSCUZbm4mMoqApLfcfYJ6PxyUiExT8_3ZZUlSXNjyg&oe=6A2FFEC6"}, "display_name": "BlindSimulator", "keywords": ["Blind", "Simulator", "Education", "Cane", "Experience"], "long_description": "**'Blind Simulator'** is a VR simulation game that offers a unique perspective by allowing players to experience the world as a blind person.\n\nPlayers begin the game without sight and must rely on a white cane as their only tool to explore their surroundings.\nTapping the cane on the ground creates a sonar effect, which temporarily reveals the shapes and objects in the nearby space.\n\n\n{1483889342761078}\n\n\nOn the journey to a hospital, players use public transportation such as buses and subways, and navigate crowded streets and unfamiliar environments \u2014 all within a fully virtual, safe-to-experience setting.\nThrough this process'**how to sense and understand the world without directly seeing it**'.\n\n\n{2251899381954384}\n\n\nThis game goes beyond a simple simulation \u2014 it conveys the everyday discomforts and fears faced by people with visual impairments.\nIt is designed with an educational purpose and presents a narrative-driven VR experience that resonates with players.\n\n\n{1438988117330894}\n\n\n**Start a new kind of exploration where you learn to \"see without seeing\" \u2014 using sound, vibration, and spatial awareness as your only guides.**\n\n\n{1846104142685848}", "short_description": "Experience the journey of a blind person navigating the world using only sound and touch in immersive VR."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero_Cover_BS.png", "id": "2518919831796602", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293144_2518919835129935_1413575938524185386_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qs_BWAunO28Q7kNvwEVXthL&_nc_oc=Adr1VyJtuVuwuW2mqXN0p73GLeBHAPNlad97bQqTxsternanV9x3eHt-tIDmCAcpFik&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-43rKfqcEO_PfPKVDy62YxXXOWM1-f-yC16PSHN_Jz7g&oe=6A3001E1"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Sight_BS.png", "id": "1889382115345316", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623599_1889382118678649_1627841262428749483_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fgCYRjXWKTMQ7kNvwHsLtNf&_nc_oc=Adq9z6x3jgoGTBHwFjMgOekKNEviwCkFhj4B3K8HRXJL13kK8lUbazHttIY7Ow0_Q2s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_u9lgCGmjK-pd1-42E-Nx6ipzdmLbQxb9ucAl5Gxzc6g&oe=6A300131"}, {"file_name": "Logo_BS.png", "id": "1282969720083144", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/4